title: Rescue
---
A tall figure in a travel-stained cloak kneels beside you in the ashes. #line:rescue_000
Stranger: Easy, little one. The bandits are gone. #line:rescue_001
Stranger: My name is Holloway. I keep the Heroes' Guild. There is nothing left for you here, but there could be something for you there. #line:rescue_002
-> Take his hand. #line:rescue_opt_go
    <<set_label guild_answer went_willingly>>
    His grip is warm and steady. He lifts you onto his horse without another word. #line:rescue_ack_go
-> No! I have to find my family! #line:rescue_opt_refuse
    <<set_label guild_answer refused>>
    <<emote player shake>>
    Holloway: If they live, you'll need to be strong enough to find them. #line:rescue_ack_refuse
    He lifts you onto his horse anyway, gently. #line:rescue_ack_refuse_2
===
